        "type": "reg",
        "input": "3\n3\n2 2 2\n4\n1 2 1 2\n5\n2 2 1 1 2",
        "output": "6\n4\n7",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\nTest case 111: Every subarray contains only twos, so the mean and median are always 222.\nEvery subarray is normal, so the answer is the count of subarrays, which is 666.\nTest case 222: The only normal subarrays are those with length 111."
      }
